{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_savage_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_savage_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"沉痛轉機","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_savage_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"2539b7809e008c7e3e029ba1418e2f6de5522144dfc6ce53828d77cc9d3589b8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"結束巴別塔的合作任務後，暴行回到雷姆必拓的礦區，守護著源石礦工人的安全，也等待著自己命運改變的某一日。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"narration","text":"2:03 P.M. 天氣/晴朗\n鋼鐵蘿蔔城城外礦區 26號礦井"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，老約翰。下井結束了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"累死了，拉我一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我這可是乾淨衣服......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼好嫌棄的，你還不是，下一班就要到下面去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"找我有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"安保人員到了，過來問問下面的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"能有什麼情況，我帶的班，這麼多年出過什麼差錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"讓安檢員直接去和下一班班長交接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去痛快地洗個澡，他們安保部門的想等我就老實等著吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......唷，意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是小姑娘嘛。長途旅行回來啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，頑固老頭兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼叫長途旅行......我可是去正經工作的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"別那麼嚴肅嘛。我知道，你是派駐到巴別塔那邊交接，順便跟著幹大事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩年，見了不少世面吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼大不了的......換個地方待著罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我的工作也涉及不到什麼核心內容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你也真是，現在知道回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道是上頭還是巴別塔出了什麼事，本來合作得好好的，突然就那樣，說結束就結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......老實說，我也毫無頭緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。回過家了沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"已經報過平安了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼時候回來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"三天前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，以前，你原先在安保部的同事們都升官了，現在你是被調回他們的手下了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，這麼著急就上崗，巴別塔那邊的事情已經全都處理好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼這副心事重重的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒想追著你問，想說什麼就說好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，明明好不容易回了老家，見到老同事們了，卻不高興？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我也......不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然很想念你們，尤其是家鄉的礦區對我來說這麼熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......總覺得，結束得太快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"（吹口哨）看你這樣子，還說沒拿到好差事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，遇到了什麼離不開的心上人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哪、哪有什麼心上人——是朋友啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......而且，我也沒做什麼值得稱道的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是聽說你接的是個重要任務啊。陸陸續續挖出那些“貨物”可花了我們兩年的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"工人們都覺得，肯定是外面發生了什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"工程量的確不小。不過，我只負責很普通的環節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"這次合作裡，為了確保從雷姆必拓送往巴別塔的“貨物”運輸安全與順利交接，有必要派遣安保人員進行對接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣，將由我們這裡的礦業公司開採到的艦體和核心，不斷送往交付到巴別塔的手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，作為安保人員，我參與了一部分和巴別塔的合作工作，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，你真的什麼都不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"（苦笑）老頭，你不是不知道，我這個人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你這姑娘......（歎氣），還是一如既往，在關鍵的時候糊里糊塗的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，薩卡茲的事情讓他們自己去解決吧！關鍵時候糊塗了，或許也是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果不是巴別塔吸引你，還能有什麼理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......以前，我十分確信，自己會在礦場中生活一輩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有關注外界的必要，可以說對外界一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是離開了次雷姆必拓，有了到外面去轉轉的機會嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我還記得，剛離開的時候，你還嚷嚷著不想走呢。所以說，年輕人啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭兒，我......認識了一個同族的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，在周圍都是薩卡茲的生活環境中，想要健康地成長是多麼困難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"但她選擇了接受。她學會了忍耐、堅持，始終懷揣著希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"她還有許多需要學習的知識，所以總是纏著我問各式各樣的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"她喜歡我做的料理，對雷姆必拓的寓言故事特別著迷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"一隻小兔子。她來自哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......雷姆必拓。但是，她不會再回來了。所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......其實，我也不知道，自己為什麼會這麼擔憂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，這還不簡單——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你想保護她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，保護她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"但是現在不是時候。我沒有理由再留在那，也沒有帶領她前進的本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，現在我該做的，應該是回到雷姆必拓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼看來，你已經找到自己的使命了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也沒有那麼嚴肅。畢竟，要是我執意留在巴別塔，別人又不想雇我，我不就可憐地失業了嘛！哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，現在就做自己該做的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我們工人在礦場裡的性命安全，都託付在你們安保人員身上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是你，夥計們看到你都會放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"至少現在，我們需要你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，老頭兒，今天你的話很多啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，對你不一樣。你現在是見過世面的人，我可不敢隨便再擺架子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，別開這種玩笑嘛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你從那麼遠的地方回來，該不會把卡特斯的傳統美德都忘記了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？什麼美德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你個小姑娘......禮物，當然是紀念禮物了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒條件離開雷姆必拓，沒辦法出去見識見識。你們這些年輕人，有著這麼好的機會，轉眼便把我給忘了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，騙你的，我怎麼會忘記嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"回來的時候，想著也不知道有沒有下次出門的機會，我特地買了好幾大箱貨物親自搬回來呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"給。這是維多利亞賣得最好的助聽器，專門送給你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這就對了嘛，不枉我和你過去搭班那麼久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"有了這個，聽孩子們說話就更清楚了。唉，這麻煩的職業病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是。那我下去檢查啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，這熟悉的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"悶熱到窒息的防護服，又重又硬的工人帽，出了汗連擦一擦都做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"在這種艱難的環境裡不斷地開採，冒著生命危險和源石作伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"族人的生命，全部都消耗在了這些越藏越深的礦井裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"——過去，這就是我生活的全部。和族人們一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"過去的數年，未來的日子，我都會這麼度過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"不行不行，想這麼多也沒有意義。我得好好工作，至少......現在我肩負的，便是老約翰他們這樣的工人的生命安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......不免還是會想......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭，你過得還好嗎。\n沒有同族人的陪伴，生活會習慣嗎？\n我......很擔心你。\n沒有人為你做美味的家鄉料理，你能夠好好地長大嗎？\n回到雷姆必拓以後，便沒有機會再取得更多聯繫。\n阿米婭......\n博士和凱爾希，他們會照顧好你的，對嗎。\n在他們身邊，你會變得堅強，擁有屬於自己的使命。\n我也......現在，還有需要由我承擔的責任。\n但是，當你需要我的那天，我一定會來幫助你。\n如果我們真的在朝著同一個方向邁步，那麼我們就一定還會重逢。\n我相信一定會的。\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩年後\n1:34  P.M. 天氣/炎熱\n鋼鐵蘿蔔城城外礦區 27、28、29號礦井"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快、快撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"粉塵快要爆炸——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃、呃啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命、咳、咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"冷靜下來，全部帶上氧氣瓶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命、救命啊——"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事，這個警報聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"是重大危險警報......礦井出事了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"報告！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不好了，27、28、29號礦井發生活性源石粉塵爆炸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......！我就說，這該死的天氣不能開工！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就為了那點產量——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"29號井......那不是......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"人員傷亡情況呢？現場是什麼狀況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有、有工人被埋在坍塌的礦井裡！確認有傷患！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*雷姆必拓俗語*，暴行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快去救援。我去控制現場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"——把防護服都穿上，和我出發！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈、哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"挖......到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭子，還活著嗎，老頭子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"——老約翰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"堅持住！握住我的手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"疼......好疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"撐住，老頭子，你還有救！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"把他拉出來，快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......醒醒，老約翰！你不能睡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"暴行，離醫療帳篷還有三百米！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"衝刺過去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我們是本次礦井事故的聯合緊急醫療小組。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"雷姆必拓礦業公司的安保小組，哈、哈......傷患......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，立即安排安置傷患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"能否先和我們登記資訊，需要立即聯繫親屬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"公司這邊會立刻安排，麻煩你們先治療他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"托馬斯，你留下來負責登記和聯絡部門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的人和我走，還有沒被救出的傷患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我和另外兩名同事是這次登記的志願緊急救助小組，來自羅德島製藥公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"（羅德島？沒有聽說過的公司......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"好，羅德島的。老頭子就......交給你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......請務必救下他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會盡力而為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......走，我們去救下一個！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，暴行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"人數對上了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不敢置信，難得連屍體也找齊了。受傷12人，重傷3人，死亡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算我不說，也沒人比你知道得更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......從現場的源石粉塵濃度看，受傷的人大概都會很危險......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"救助站。我要去看看老頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"對了。這次參與救助的志願者中，有一些醫療人員來自“羅德島”。部長你有聽說過這個組織嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島？......沒有聽說過，大概是新成立的公司吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部長","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你去吧，正好也檢查一下。順便去看看那個羅德島是什麼來頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，請問您是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是安保部門的人吧！之前運送第一批傷患的也是您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我暴行就好。我來看看傷患的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......剛才，有一位登記叫做約翰的傷患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是約翰先生嗎？請您放心，醫療幹員已經為約翰先生做過應急處理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"他......傷得如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是，源石結晶刺入了他的手臂和側腹，防護服因此被割破，隨後吸收到的源石粉塵含量也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，他已經確定感染了，是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......可惡。還是沒趕上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，已經為約翰先生做過了應急處理，使用了羅德島的注射藥劑之後，已經避免了進一步感染擴散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？......可是，傷到這種程度，又是活性源石結晶直接刺入傷口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白您的顧慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我暴行就好。你剛才說，用了你們的注射藥劑之後已經避免擴散了，這是真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，暴行小姐，目前運送到救助站的傷患，都已經根據受傷程度和感染程度使用了相應的應急藥物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"失血過於嚴重的病人還未脫離危險，但是患者的源石感染症狀已經基本抑制住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"都抑制住了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，全部......有什麼問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，只是，哪怕是效果好上一些的藥劑，也不是能給工人們立即使用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"在雷姆必拓現存的醫療組織中，所使用的廉價源石感染應急藥物對已經感染的工人作用十分有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"但是羅德島卻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是志願援助小組沒錯吧？這些應急藥劑不便宜，用量也很可觀，你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我，我並不負責這一部分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我向您保證，約翰先生已經脫離了生命危險，不久後就能接受探望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"不一樣......一旦成為感染者，工人們的命運就已經被決定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"被迫成為更加廉價的勞動力，去到已經枯竭的礦井做最辛苦和危險的尾料收集工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起，患者被送到的時候，大多已經......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"該說對不起的是我。抱歉，明明你們已經做得足夠多了......非常感謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"暴行小姐，我......我明白您的感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希主任曾教導我們，哪怕傷口可以癒合、礦石病感染得以抑制......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦成為感染者，對於社會的大部分人來說，仇恨和偏見就已經不可理喻地形成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。凱爾希的確是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，你們的主任是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是凱爾希女士。她可是我們羅德島所有醫療幹員的榜樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希......主任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"難道說......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你們的領袖呢？羅德島，你們羅德島組織的領袖叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"她，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，拜託你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的首領，羅德島組織現任領袖，她的名字是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"“阿米婭”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿......米婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......請問，有什麼問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會是阿米婭......如果真的是她，現在她的年齡也不過——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是的，我們的領袖十分年輕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......只要和阿米婭進行過一次交流便會知道，她擁有超越年齡的智慧和堅強的意志，是一位真正優秀的領導者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"暴行小姐您會知道這些......莫非，是阿米婭小姐的舊識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......嗯，我們......從很久以前就是好友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......你們能聯繫到阿米婭嗎？只要說出我的名字，她一定會明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。阿米婭小姐的確說過，她有十分親密的好友，現在或許就在雷姆必拓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"真的，真的是阿米婭......我能去見她嗎？應該怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在就去聯繫羅德島的信使。還有，暴行小姐，如果您有什麼話想要帶給她......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"聲音逐漸淡去。\n在兩年的時光裡，暴行孑然一身，駐守在雷姆必拓礦區不曾離開。\n她迷茫。她思索。\n她曾想，接下去的人生或許就該在雷姆必拓安然度過。\n然而，喚醒暴行的鬥志和決心是如此輕而易舉。\n就在一瞬間——在聽到自己曾朝夕相處、關愛的名字從他人口中念出的那一刻。\n暴行已經明白，她一定會做出什麼樣的決定。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"十五日後\n鋼鐵蘿蔔城郊區 救助站 感染者病房內"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......知道自己成了感染者的一瞬間，我甚至在想，是不是死了之後獲得的撫恤金能讓家裡人過得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想著......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎，我第一件想到的事情，是問自己，該用什麼表情面對我的家人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"老婆和孩子都不喜歡我生氣的樣子，更不可能喜歡我哭喪的臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，見到他們的時候，我真的笑得出來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不像你，老頭兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"誰不知道，你可是方圓十公里最樂觀的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"連你都垂著耳朵去見家人，弟兄們又該怎麼面對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是，就是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老約翰這愁眉苦臉的樣子，把大家心情都搞壞啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那是你們沒有一群孩子要養，不知道其中的苦難。生活可難著呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們以後的日子也難著呢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，暴行，你別再接他們的話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經想好了，繼續在雷姆必拓做工的待遇實在養不活家裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"等病好起來，我們乾脆就去哥倫比亞，大家一起加入“大拓荒”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭......你真的準備離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"當我是雷姆必拓礦業的礦工的時候，我就是最勤奮、最賣力的工人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我是感染者了，不管還剩多少日子，我也要讓家人一直過幸福穩定的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你有沒有想過，只要雷姆必拓的礦一天不挖完，這樣往復的日子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"暴行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"每個人，每個時代，都有著不得不肩負的使命和責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來不為自己成為一個礦場工人羞愧。在雷姆必拓，沒有人會這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"但是暴行，幾年前你離開雷姆必拓，兩年前又回來後，你的想法變了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你從小就不是個普通兔子。每個人都有自己的使命和責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你的錘子救了我們的命，接下來的日子，你也會拯救更多的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有必須要保護的人，那就離開吧。我也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，看你那表情。其實你早就決定好了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"別說得好像我是個無情的傢伙嘛，老頭兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，這是我一定要去做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我有必須保護的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"終於......我又找到她，能夠見到她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是一份綿薄之力，為了她，我也會傾盡所有的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，哪有什麼值得“傾盡所有”的事情，都是你們年輕人太天真了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......說得好像當初為了家人下井、現在要為了家人離開的人不是你。你不也是拼盡全力，傾盡所有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哪一樣？我這是養家糊口......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"是是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你準備什麼時候出發？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"今天。再最後來看一看你，然後就要啟程了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這兩年裡，有你的幫忙，我們才沒出什麼事故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"即便是這次，也是你救出了還活著的我們......感激不盡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"說這些可就讓我沒法謙讓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭，可要好好珍惜我救下的命，把接下來的日子過好哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"臭丫頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老約翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"再見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"再見。老約翰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"（......暫時要告別了，雷姆必拓。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，久等了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"暴行小姐，已經完成道別了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭也真是......到最後還提醒我，讓我回家裡再認真告別一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天回家和父母道別的時候，母親可還在念叨著“下次回來也該有對象了”呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......我這是為了事業！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"真是其樂融融呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"和本艦溝通後快速辦理的入職申請已經通過了。這些是人事招聘合約。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"詳細的工作事務就在抵達本艦後交接吧，羅德島十分歡迎暴行小姐您的到來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島醫療幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼......暴行小姐，一路順風。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......終於，終於。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，你變成什麼樣了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已經成長為領袖了，真了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等著我吧，阿米婭。不論發生了什麼，現在肩負著什麼樣的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有好多想告訴你、想和你分享的故事。你會想聽嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這兩年裡，你遇到的快樂的事情、難過的事情，我遇到的快樂的事情、難過的事情——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在見面以後，來盡情訴說吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["羅德島醫療幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_230_savage","aliases":["暴行"]}]}
